sequenceDiagram
  title Timer Hammer And Evidence Flow v4
  participant T as Timer Worker
  participant Z as Redis active ZSET
  participant L as Redis Lua close_auction.lua
  participant S as Redis Stream
  participant P as Redis Pub/Sub
  participant W as WS Gateway
  participant PW as Persistence Worker
  participant O as Order Service
  participant M as MySQL
  participant E as Evidence Generator
  participant V as Replay Verifier

  T->>Z: ZRANGEBYSCORE endAtMs <= now
  Z-->>T: candidate auction ids
  T->>L: EVALSHA close_auction.lua(auctionId)
  L->>L: re-check Redis TIME, now >= endAtMs

  alt not due after re-check
    L-->>T: ERR_NOT_DUE(msRemaining)
  else already terminal
    L-->>T: ERR_ALREADY_TERMINAL(status)
  else highest bid exists
    L->>S: XADD AUCTION_SOLD <seq>-0
    L->>P: PUBLISH AUCTION_SOLD
    P-->>W: room wakeup
    W-->>W: broadcast AUCTION_SOLD
    PW->>S: consume ordered event
    PW->>M: insert auction_events, bids projection
    O->>M: create order with UNIQUE(auction_id)
    E->>M: write evidence card and hash chain fields
    V->>S: replay Stream
    V->>M: compare MySQL projection
  else no accepted bid
    L->>S: XADD AUCTION_NO_BID <seq>-0
    L->>P: PUBLISH AUCTION_NO_BID
    P-->>W: room wakeup
    W-->>W: broadcast AUCTION_NO_BID
    PW->>S: consume ordered event
    PW->>M: insert terminal event
  end

  Note over T,V: SLOs: hammer p95 under 500ms. Detection lag at most 120ms. Settled Replay Verifier returns consistent.
